# The Power BI project is generated and CI compares it byte for byte
# (`python -m powerbi.build_pbip --check`). A Windows checkout that rewrote its
# line endings would fail that check with nothing changed, so text stays LF
# everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.parquet binary
*.pdf binary
*.pbix binary
*.zip binary


# The 2024 hackathon notebooks are kept as history, not as the project. Without this
# they are three-quarters of the language bar and the repo reads as a notebook.
legacy/** linguist-documentation
